<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="cta-card glass-card">
    <h2 class="section-title-en">READ NOW</h2>
    <p class="cta-heading">物語の続きは、カクヨムで。</p>
    <p class="cta-text">
      理性と恋がせめぎ合うその結末を、<br />
      どうか最後まで見届けてください。
    </p>
    <a
      href="https://kakuyomu.jp/works/2912051598581907032"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="cta-button"
    >
      カクヨムで<br class="br-mobile" />本編を読む
      <svg
        xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
        width="20"
        height="20"
        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        fill="none"
        stroke="currentColor"
        stroke-width="2"
        stroke-linecap="round"
        stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg
      >
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta-section {
    padding: 4rem 0;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .cta-card {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--lp-accent);
    padding: 2rem;
  }
  .cta-heading {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--lp-text);
  }
  .cta-text {
    color: var(--lp-text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .cta-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    background-color: var(--lp-accent);
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }
  .cta-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(216, 167, 177, 0.4);
    filter: brightness(1.05);
  }
  .br-mobile {
    display: none;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .br-mobile {
      display: inline;
    }
    .cta-section {
      padding: 5rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
